cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or quote these benchmarks, please cite them as below."
title: "Spheron GPU Benchmarks: LLM inference throughput and latency on cloud GPUs"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Spheron"
    website: "https://www.spheron.network"
version: "2026.11.23"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
repository-code: "https://github.com/spheronai/gpu-benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/spheronai/gpu-benchmarks"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
abstract: >-
  490 dated LLM inference load measurements recorded between 2026-10-08 and 2026-11-21
  on NVIDIA B300, B200, H200, H100, RTX PRO 6000, L40S, A100 and other GPUs with
  vLLM and SGLang, plus a dependency-free Python client for measuring any
  OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Data and charts are CC BY 4.0; code is MIT.
keywords:
  - gpu benchmarks
  - llm inference
  - vllm
  - sglang
  - throughput
  - latency
  - b300
  - b200
  - h100
